{:itonami.blueprint/id "cloud-itonami-unspsc-39"
 :itonami.blueprint/name "Independent Solar & EV-Charging Install & Diagnostics"
 :itonami.blueprint/unspsc-segment "39"
 :itonami.blueprint/domain :energy/solar-ev-electrical
 :itonami.blueprint/license "AGPL-3.0-or-later"
 :itonami.blueprint/social-impact [:decarbonization :energy-affordability :local-jobs]
 :itonami.blueprint/governor :electrical-install-governor
 :itonami.blueprint/robotics true
 :itonami.blueprint/required-technologies [:robotics :telemetry :forms :dmn :bpmn :audit-ledger]
 :itonami.blueprint/status :public-oss
 :itonami.blueprint/maturity :implemented
 :itonami.blueprint/implemented-slice
 "DiagnosticsAdvisor ⊣ Electrical Install Governor, langgraph-clj
 StateGraph, append-only audit ledger. An install-and-diagnostics
 operator coordination actor (panel/charger diagnostic-reading data
 logging, repair/install-visit scheduling against customer sites,
 live-circuit/grid-interconnection safety-concern flagging,
 commissioning-record coordination against an electrical circuit) --
 not direct circuit-actuation authority and not commissioning/
 interconnection-approval-certification authority. Four ops
 (`:log-diagnostic-reading` / `:schedule-repair` / `:flag-safety-
 concern` / `:issue-commissioning-record`), all `:effect :propose`
 only. Twelve concrete governor checks elaborate this blueprint's four
 HARD invariants: propose-only effect, closed op allowlist, closed
 proposal-effect allowlist (no direct circuit control), permanent
 circuit-actuate block (grounded in OSHA 29 CFR 1910.333 de-
 energization/lockout-tagout and NFPA 70E), permanent commissioning/
 interconnection-approval-certification-authority block, independent
 site verification/registration before repair scheduling, independent
 circuit verification/registration before commissioning coordination,
 independent cumulative committed-load recompute against the circuit's
 own logged rated capacity, double-schedule guard, fault-type
 validation, voltage plausibility validation, and current plausibility
 validation. Safety-concern flagging ALWAYS escalates to a human
 qualified electrician; `:log-diagnostic-reading` is the only op
 eligible to auto-commit, and only at phase 3 when governor-clean."}
